'''Narro Sienar Boulevard''' was a waterway-spanning [[speeder]] bridge located in [[Coronet City]], the [[capital]] [[city]] of the [[planet]] [[Corellia]]. It was a part of the planet's system to connect island-like architectural units called pills.<ref name="Solo Guide" />

{{Loc-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
Narro Sienar Boulevard first appeared in the [[2018]] film ''[[Solo: A Star Wars Story]]''<ref name="Solo">''[[Solo: A Star Wars Story]]''</ref> and was first identified in the novel ''[[Most Wanted]]'', written by [[Rae Carson]],<ref name="Most Wanted">''[[Most Wanted]]''</ref> as well as the accompanying reference book ''[[Solo: A Star Wars Story The Official Guide]]'', written by [[Pablo Hidalgo]],<ref name="Solo Guide" /> all released simultaneously with the film on [[May 25]], 2018.<ref name="Release dates">{{SW|url=news/solo-a-star-wars-story-books-and-comics-revealed|text=''Solo: A Star Wars Story'' Books and Comics Revealed}}</ref> Narro Sienar Boulevard shares its name with the [[Star Wars Legends|''Star Wars'' Legends]] character [[Narro Sienar]].<ref name="TNEGtC">''[[The New Essential Guide to Characters]]''</ref>

